      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know... i'm just really anxious about the side effects of antibiotics like the gut issues and stuff. but it feels pretty bad right now. if i took a lot of oregano oil at once, like 2000mg or something, wouldn't that be strong enough to act like a natural antibiotic? i've read online that it has antibacterial properties so i'm hoping i can just ride it out for a few days with the supplements instead of going to a clinic. isn't it usually just a minor thing that clears up?",
